oods or take on small tasks for extra rewards.\n\nAnimals are part of your farm too \u2013 you feed and water them, build pens, and collect what they produce. Whether you like to play at your own pace or plan things out for maximum efficiency is completely up to you.", "themes": [{"id": 33, "name": "Sandbox"}, {"id": 38, "name": "Open world"}], "url": "https://www.igdb.com/games/fields-of-fortune"}